        "content": "<img src=\"modules/alien-deep-down/assets/tokens/CIXIN_LIU/CIXIN_LIU.png\" height=\"300\"><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>FULL NAME:</strong> CIXIN LIU</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>OCCUPATION:</strong> STATION ENGINEER</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>AGE:</strong> 52</p><p></p><p><span style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"> </span></p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"> </span></p><img src=\"modules/alien-deep-down/assets/tokens/OLGA_KRAMARENKO/OLGA_KRAMARENKO_prt.png\" height=\"300\"><p><strong>FULL NAME:</strong> Cpt. Olga Kramarenko</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>OCCUPATION:</strong> MSS Agent</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>AGE:</strong> 36<span style=\"font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif\"><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break;page-break-before:always\"></span></p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language:PT-BR\"> </span></p><img src=\"modules/alien-deep-down/assets/tokens/IVAN_DUBOV/IVAN_DUBOV.png\" height=\"300\"><p></p><p><strong>FULL NAME:</strong> IVAN DUBOV</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>OCCUPATION:</strong> MACHINE OPERATOR</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>AGE:</strong> 25</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif\"><br style=\"mso-special-character:line-break;page-break-before:always\"></span></p><img src=\"modules/alien-deep-down/assets/tokens/KIM_PHAM/KIM_PHAM.png\" height=\"300\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman',serif\"> </span></p><p><strong>FULL NAME:</strong> KIM PHAM</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>OCCUPATION:</strong> DIVING SPECIALIST / DOCTOR</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>AGE:</strong> 28</p><p></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:'Aptos',sans-serif\"><br styl