    {
      "sort": 0,
      "name": "Animated login",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "rYRQdFe7eAGZaTZq",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p></p><p>If you're looking for a nice animated login for your game, copy paste the address (bellow) as the background image in your World settings window!<br></p><p>If you didn’t know, animated WEBP files work like GIFs and are fully supported in that configuration. 🎮</p><p><br>The SPLASH was created Using scenes from the Movie \"Underwater\" public Trailer, 20th Century FOX - Go see IT if you like!</p><p></p><p><strong>modules/alien-deep-down/assets/other/deep_down_SPLASH.webp<br><br></strong></p><img src=\"modules/alien-deep-down/assets/other/READ-ME/nice-login.png\" height=\"300\">"
      },
